  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Could your body's defense system hurt you?",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.7800000000000002,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your immune system normally helps fight infections,",
      "start": 3.0400000000000005,
      "end": 5.855,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "but in sepsis,",
      "start": 6.04,
      "end": 7.43,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "that response can damage your own organs.",
      "start": 7.53,
      "end": 10.315,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "Look at the lining of a tiny",
      "start": 10.575,
      "end": 11.975,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "blood vessel.",
      "start": 11.975,
      "end": 12.999999999999998,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inflammatory signals can make this barrier leaky.",
      "start": 13.435,
      "end": 16.63,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fluid moves into surrounding tissue.",
      "start": 17.0,
      "end": 19.335,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the same time,",
      "start": 19.79,
      "end": 20.97,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "clotting can obstruct small vessels.",
      "start": 21.01,
      "end": 23.150000000000002,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "That can disrupt blood flow, so organs",
      "start": 23.43,
      "end": 25.84,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "struggle to get the oxygen they need.",
      "start": 25.84,
      "end": 28.075,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "The infection matters,",
      "start": 28.334999999999997,
      "end": 30.029999999999998,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "but part of the damage comes from",
      "start": 30.169999999999998,
      "end": 31.969999999999995,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "the body's response to it.",
      "start": 31.969999999999995,
      "end": 33.56,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sepsis is more complicated than an immune",
      "start": 34.05,
      "end": 36.61,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "system simply being too strong.",
      "start": 36.61,
      "end": 38.915,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "Some defenses can also become suppressed.",
      "start": 39.23,
      "end": 42.17,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a medical emergency.",
      "start": 42.43000000000001,
      "end": 44.49500000000001,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "Early treatment matters.",
      "start": 44.79500000000001,
      "end": 46.345000000000006,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "Protection depends on control,",
      "start": 46.60500000000001,
      "end": 48.68000000000001,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    },
    {
      "text": "not just force.",
      "start": 48.95000000000001,
      "end": 50.53000000000001,
      "timing": "Acoustic utterance anchor; internal ASR estimates"
    }
  ],
